  "devNoteTitle": "Note from the developer",
  "devNoteIntro": "On heavily filtered networks, and in Iran above all, MASQUE over HTTP/3 rarely stays up. HTTP/3 rides on QUIC, and QUIC is UDP, which is the first thing those networks throttle or drop. If your line is restricted, do not start there.",
